        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/matchstickman/{size}/1880_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-01-24T19:45:27.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>You need to complete all the instructions on a card before it goes in the trash (including anything that gets played/triggered effects because of that card).</p><p>Ambuscade's Armed and Dangerous is still in play when it shuffles the trash, it will remain in play until after the card it plays has finished resolving too.</p>",
