        "raw": "<p>You need to complete all the instructions on a card before it goes in the trash (including anything that gets played/triggered effects because of that card).</p><p>Ambuscade&#39;s Armed and Dangerous is still in play when it shuffles the trash, it will remain in play until after the card it plays has finished resolving too.</p>",
